# Line-ending normalization.
#
# This repo lives on a Windows drive and is edited from both PowerShell and WSL.
# Without this file, switching between them rewrites whole files with CRLF and
# `git status` shows ~17 files as fully modified when nothing actually changed.
#
# `text=auto eol=lf` stores LF in the index and checks out LF everywhere, so both
# environments agree. Existing CRLF working-tree files are compared normalized,
# so they go quiet immediately without needing a renormalize commit.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets git must never line-ending-convert.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
